1
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,426
[Indonesia]

2
00:00:25,745 --> 00:00:27,229
[38-hour non-stop livestreamer, Mami]

3
00:00:27,229 --> 00:00:29,413
Hello, I'm Mami Louisse.

4
00:00:29,413 --> 00:00:31,940
I joined X THE LEAGUE
as a member of Team Indonesia

5
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:36,041
to compete for the honor of Indonesia.

6
00:00:36,041 --> 00:00:38,041
I have almost 20 million followers.

7
00:00:39,853 --> 00:00:43,621
["Mami Louisse's livestream achieves
one million dollars in sales in a day"]

8
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:45,862
[Highest sales record in Asia]

9
00:00:45,862 --> 00:00:48,932
[Awarded "Successful Women"
in digital marketing]

10
00:00:48,932 --> 00:00:53,886
[Top 1 creator in global beauty
for two years in a row]

11
00:00:53,886 --> 00:00:56,613
I can livestream for 38 hours non-stop.

12
00:00:56,613 --> 00:00:58,143
For 38 hours?

13
00:00:58,143 --> 00:00:59,557
38 hours?

14
00:01:01,204 --> 00:01:06,083
One time, I did a mega-showcase livestream
for 28 hours non-stop.

15
00:01:06,083 --> 00:01:09,759
That was when I was carrying my fifth child.

16
00:01:09,759 --> 00:01:12,174
[Mami has done a 28-hour livestream]

17
00:01:12,174 --> 00:01:15,003
It was a big livestream for a mega-showcase

18
00:01:15,003 --> 00:01:17,613
that resulted in the highest sales across Asia.

19
00:01:18,235 --> 00:01:20,916
[The highest sales in Asia were recorded
while she was heavily pregnant]

20
00:01:20,916 --> 00:01:23,886
I gave birth to my child the day after.

21
00:01:25,402 --> 00:01:28,003
I start livestreaming every day at seven.

22
00:01:28,003 --> 00:01:31,963
It usually continues until noon on weekdays.

23
00:01:31,963 --> 00:01:35,526
Then I start livestreaming again at six.

24
00:01:35,526 --> 00:01:37,848
[Nine hours of livestreaming on average
every day]

25
00:01:37,848 --> 00:01:41,371
I'm going to my office to livestream.

26
00:01:47,493 --> 00:01:49,013
This is my office.

27
00:01:49,013 --> 00:01:53,544
Downstairs is the factory,
and next to that is the warehouse.

28
00:01:53,544 --> 00:01:57,259
[Factory, warehouse, and livestreaming studio
all together]

29
00:01:57,259 --> 00:01:58,998
[One-stop solution]

30
00:02:00,271 --> 00:02:03,940
I sell skincare and cosmetic products.

31
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:07,241
I'm running three brands named after my kids.

32
00:02:07,241 --> 00:02:10,617
[Mami is a supermom of five children]

33
00:02:10,617 --> 00:02:14,417
Louisse *** products are mainly
for adult skincare.

34
00:02:14,417 --> 00:02:18,323
So I named it after my first child.

35
00:02:18,323 --> 00:02:21,920
My second child's name is Loewy Axell.

36
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:24,371
So my second brand's name is Loewy ***.

37
00:02:24,371 --> 00:02:26,897
The third is Lonnel ***.

38
00:02:26,897 --> 00:02:29,737
Lonnel *** is a skincare brand for children.

39
00:02:31,554 --> 00:02:34,087
[Mami is a seller and a CEO of three brands]

40
00:02:34,087 --> 00:02:37,065
Why did I use my children's names
for my brands?

41
00:02:37,065 --> 00:02:40,297
That was because I wanted to give a sense
of trust

42
00:02:40,297 --> 00:02:43,106
that my products had already gone
through a strict validation process.

43
00:02:43,106 --> 00:02:45,363
My children and family test them first,

44
00:02:45,363 --> 00:02:46,847
and when they approve of them,

45
00:02:46,847 --> 00:02:49,087
they can be sold to customers with confidence.

46
00:02:49,087 --> 00:02:51,609
[Only selling family-approved products]

47
00:02:53,594 --> 00:02:57,394
[Sales goal of Round 2: 50 billion rupiah
(3.9 billion won)]

48
00:02:57,394 --> 00:03:01,365
I'm confident I'll sell out.

49
00:03:01,365 --> 00:03:03,423
I'm not content with 90%.

50
00:03:03,423 --> 00:03:04,904
I'm very competitive.

51
00:03:04,904 --> 00:03:09,616
In X THE LEAGUE, let's do our best to make sure

52
00:03:09,616 --> 00:03:13,483
Team Indonesia hits a 95% sales rate
in livestreaming.

53
00:03:13,483 --> 00:03:14,800
I don't want to lose.

54
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,336
Team Indonesia cannot lose.

55
00:03:16,336 --> 00:03:18,692
[Yearning for first place in Round 2]

56
00:03:19,546 --> 00:03:22,808
[Mami starts live selling for Round 2]
I'm starting now. Okay?

57
00:03:22,808 --> 00:03:29,508
Today I'm live for X THE LEAGUE.

58
00:03:32,129 --> 00:03:34,539
Wait. Where are my black agents?

59
00:03:34,539 --> 00:03:36,536
[Who are the black agents Mami is looking for?]

60
00:03:36,536 --> 00:03:39,155
Come in.

61
00:03:39,155 --> 00:03:41,508
[Mysterious black agents enter the livestream]

62
00:03:41,508 --> 00:03:43,405
[Who are they?]

63
00:03:43,405 --> 00:03:46,800
[Black agents to work the audience
in the livestream]

64
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,116
Come here, any of you good-looking men.

65
00:03:49,116 --> 00:03:50,448
[Should I?]

66
00:03:50,448 --> 00:03:52,801
Show us how much better you look
with this sunscreen on.

67
00:03:52,801 --> 00:03:55,798
[Performance testing using an agent
as a model]

68
00:03:55,798 --> 00:03:59,186
It leaves no white cast. It's perfect for men.

69
00:03:59,186 --> 00:04:03,335
Look at the camera.
Apply the skincare products yourself.

70
00:04:03,335 --> 00:04:07,762
[Appeals to consumers
through a product demonstration]

71
00:04:08,947 --> 00:04:12,272
We're sold out. Sold out!

72
00:04:12,888 --> 00:04:14,686
[Sold out thanks to product demonstrations]

73
00:04:14,686 --> 00:04:16,527
[Mami's livestream doesn't end here]

74
00:04:16,527 --> 00:04:19,545
Who's here for the brand new rich body lotion?

75
00:04:19,545 --> 00:04:21,983
[Keeping the livestream going
with three more products]

76
00:04:21,983 --> 00:04:26,449
[A non-stop livestream
to boost Team Indonesia's sales]

77
00:04:26,449 --> 00:04:30,340
I want Indonesia to beat the other seven teams
and be the final winner.

78
00:04:30,340 --> 00:04:32,128
Please show Indonesia's passion to the world.

79
00:04:32,128 --> 00:04:35,243
Indonesia will win!

80
00:04:35,243 --> 00:04:38,243
[How will Indonesia do in Round 2?]

81
00:04:38,243 --> 00:04:41,793
[Three days before Round 2 sales begin]

82
00:04:42,427 --> 00:04:45,502
[A somewhat familiar landscape?]

83
00:04:47,568 --> 00:04:49,588
[Jeju?]

84
00:04:50,230 --> 00:04:53,138
[Who is livestreaming on Jeju Island?]

85
00:04:53,138 --> 00:04:55,042
[The K-beauty sales queen of Malaysia]
Today's a really important day.

86
00:04:55,042 --> 00:04:57,470
I'm wearing a wedding dress.

87
00:04:57,470 --> 00:05:01,438
I have a wedding photoshoot
with my groom-to-be.

88
00:05:01,438 --> 00:05:04,123
[Why is she shooting her wedding photos
in Korea?]

89
00:05:04,123 --> 00:05:07,664
Because I am dating a Korean boyfriend.

90
00:05:07,664 --> 00:05:10,806
We're ending
our long-distance relationship soon,

91
00:05:10,806 --> 00:05:13,747
and we'll get married this year.

92
00:05:13,747 --> 00:05:15,560
Congratulations.

93
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,735
Thank you so much.

94
00:05:17,735 --> 00:05:19,403
I arrived here yesterday.

95
00:05:19,403 --> 00:05:21,572
We're here for wedding photos.

96
00:05:21,572 --> 00:05:27,069
But then I heard Nania Jewelry has a showroom
on Jeju Island.

97
00:05:27,069 --> 00:05:30,652
[A chance to check out the products to sell]

98
00:05:32,928 --> 00:05:35,795
[Even so, is she really working
when she's here for a photoshoot?]

99
00:05:35,795 --> 00:05:39,053
I know I'm traveling, but work is work.

100
00:05:39,053 --> 00:05:41,895
I wanted to see and select the products myself.

101
00:05:41,895 --> 00:05:46,394
[Wedding photoshoot can't stop her passion]
- Are these new? - Yes, they are.

102
00:05:47,069 --> 00:05:50,684
Even though the unit price is higher,

103
00:05:50,684 --> 00:05:54,083
I'd like to add more brands
that give more value for money in Round 2.

104
00:05:54,083 --> 00:05:55,542
[A genuine reaction]

105
00:05:55,542 --> 00:05:56,702
They look great on you.

106
00:05:56,702 --> 00:05:59,716
- They are so pretty.
- Right.

107
00:05:59,716 --> 00:06:02,132
[The two sit awkwardly across from each other]

108
00:06:02,132 --> 00:06:07,189
My Malaysian fans love your brand.

109
00:06:07,189 --> 00:06:08,626
Oh, thank you.

110
00:06:08,626 --> 00:06:10,120
But...

111
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,520
But...

112
00:06:12,576 --> 00:06:14,043
It's the price.

113
00:06:14,043 --> 00:06:16,691
[Getting down to negotiation]
Can we talk about the prices?

114
00:06:16,691 --> 00:06:18,091
[Baffled]

115
00:06:19,296 --> 00:06:24,668
Since you love our products so much,

116
00:06:24,668 --> 00:06:27,200
for this time only,

117
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:29,310
we can offer 50% off this product.

118
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:31,500
[A special 50% off deal only for Sonia]
50%.

119
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:34,504
[Can't hide a smile]
It's a special discount for you.

120
00:06:34,504 --> 00:06:36,187
[Reconfirming]
50%?

121
00:06:36,187 --> 00:06:37,407
- 50%?
- Yes.

122
00:06:37,407 --> 00:06:39,294
[The 50% off deal is made]
Okay, deal.

123
00:06:39,294 --> 00:06:41,384
[Again]
But...

124
00:06:41,384 --> 00:06:43,459
[Clapping stopped]
But...

125
00:06:43,459 --> 00:06:48,297
[A lot of "buts" in the negotiation]
But...

126
00:06:48,297 --> 00:06:50,895
[What offer is she asking for now?]
- Just a second. - Sure.

127
00:06:50,895 --> 00:06:56,734
How about we give a discount for the keyring
if a customer buys the earrings?

128
00:06:56,734 --> 00:06:58,782
At this price?

129
00:06:58,782 --> 00:07:01,003
What do you think?

130
00:07:01,003 --> 00:07:04,786
[A shocking price catches the CEO off guard]
Buy one and get the second one at this price.

131
00:07:04,786 --> 00:07:06,511
[Debating]

132
00:07:06,511 --> 00:07:09,618
[Time out!]
I think I need to consult some people.

133
00:07:09,618 --> 00:07:11,740
I'll have to talk to some people.

134
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:15,461
But Malaysian fans love bundles.

135
00:07:15,461 --> 00:07:18,312
[Bundles are Sonia's top sales priority]
If they buy the necklace with the earrings...

136
00:07:18,312 --> 00:07:22,599
The most important thing that differentiates me
from other contestants is

137
00:07:22,599 --> 00:07:27,018
that I'm really good at putting together
a good-priced bundle product.

138
00:07:27,018 --> 00:07:31,468
[A winning strategy: selling product bundles]
Buy one and get the second one at this price.

139
00:07:31,468 --> 00:07:33,214
[Sigh]

140
00:07:33,214 --> 00:07:35,815
[Will Sonia be able to get the bundle deal?]
This is practically impossible.

141
00:07:35,815 --> 00:07:38,375
- This is good.
- Yes.

142
00:07:38,375 --> 00:07:41,497
Then, when you start selling our products,

143
00:07:41,497 --> 00:07:44,581
do you think you can sell over 1,000 units?

144
00:07:46,037 --> 00:07:47,298
Of course.

145
00:07:47,298 --> 00:07:48,915
[Beaming]

146
00:07:48,915 --> 00:07:51,522
[You can trust me]
Okay, then.

147
00:07:51,522 --> 00:07:56,840
[A bundle deal and negotiation are done]
Then, the deal is made.

148
00:07:58,371 --> 00:08:01,825
[It's pouring on her second day on Jeju Island]

149
00:08:02,666 --> 00:08:07,204
I'm shooting for wedding photos today...

150
00:08:07,204 --> 00:08:08,666
The rain ruined it!

151
00:08:08,666 --> 00:08:10,672
The chance of rain is 100%.

152
00:08:10,672 --> 00:08:13,063
So, yeah.

153
00:08:13,063 --> 00:08:17,019
[Exploring all around Jeju]

154
00:08:17,019 --> 00:08:19,009
Then, let's go to the studio.

155
00:08:19,009 --> 00:08:23,279
[Giving up on outdoor shooting]
Shoot inside briefly and pick another date.

156
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:25,854
[Is Sonia disheartened
after the shooting fell through?]

157
00:08:25,854 --> 00:08:28,594
[She is editing a video
after the shooting fell through!]

158
00:08:28,594 --> 00:08:31,398
[Editing a video in a moving car?]

159
00:08:31,398 --> 00:08:34,189
[In fact, since last night in her room...]
One, two, three.

160
00:08:34,189 --> 00:08:35,190
One, two, three.

161
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:37,298
[Sonia's been busy shooting reels
without her husband]

162
00:08:37,298 --> 00:08:38,816
One, two, three.

163
00:08:38,816 --> 00:08:42,557
[Shooting after shooting]

164
00:08:42,557 --> 00:08:45,785
[Even during the makeup this morning]

165
00:08:45,785 --> 00:08:48,501
[Sonia cannot put her phone down]

166
00:08:48,501 --> 00:08:50,270
What are you watching on your phone?

167
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:52,303
On my phone? I'm editing.

168
00:08:52,303 --> 00:08:57,753
[A bride-to-be busy editing her videos]
Okay.

169
00:08:57,753 --> 00:09:00,828
[Q: What makes you work so hard?]

170
00:09:00,828 --> 00:09:02,454
Because I like my own editing style.

171
00:09:02,454 --> 00:09:04,432
I know my style best.

172
00:09:04,432 --> 00:09:08,045
I'd like to take the opportunity in this round

173
00:09:08,045 --> 00:09:12,257
to show that those who make an effort will
reap what they sow.

174
00:09:12,257 --> 00:09:14,650
I used to be an ordinary part-time worker.

175
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:18,785
I sold rings or necklaces.

176
00:09:18,785 --> 00:09:23,277
I've enjoyed taking videos
since my university days.

177
00:09:23,277 --> 00:09:27,411
[A girl who liked shopping and taking videos
of what she got]

178
00:09:27,411 --> 00:09:31,258
[She worked on creating content
without a break]

179
00:09:32,456 --> 00:09:34,875
When I first came across the concept
of "livestream commerce,"

180
00:09:34,875 --> 00:09:38,274
I thought, "Why don't I sell things myself?"

181
00:09:38,274 --> 00:09:42,188
On my first livestream,

182
00:09:42,188 --> 00:09:47,087
I sold 18 million won worth of products
in 30 minutes.

183
00:09:47,087 --> 00:09:49,780
I felt really accomplished
after my first livestream.

184
00:09:49,780 --> 00:09:54,032
I felt like I realized my purpose in life.

185
00:09:54,032 --> 00:09:58,549
I was reassured that I could stand
on my own two feet.

186
00:09:58,549 --> 00:10:01,949
That's why I'm still doing it.

187
00:10:02,912 --> 00:10:05,148
[Sonia finally starts her wedding photoshoot]

188
00:10:06,789 --> 00:10:10,008
[The photoshoot goes on in good spirits]

189
00:10:14,536 --> 00:10:15,936
What?

190
00:10:16,639 --> 00:10:18,399
What?

191
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,898
What?

192
00:10:19,898 --> 00:10:22,790
[A groom-to-be's surprise]
What?

193
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:24,490
[Happy]

194
00:10:25,483 --> 00:10:27,043
Your mom is watching, too.

195
00:10:27,043 --> 00:10:28,539
She's watching, too.

196
00:10:28,539 --> 00:10:30,130
[Tearing up]

197
00:10:31,957 --> 00:10:33,930
[Parents watching them on video calls]

198
00:10:35,576 --> 00:10:38,414
[His heartfelt message]

199
00:10:41,423 --> 00:10:46,579
I didn't know when to propose to you
because this is my first time.

200
00:10:46,579 --> 00:10:49,646
Will you marry me?

201
00:10:50,874 --> 00:10:52,274
[Nodding]

202
00:10:54,706 --> 00:10:59,679
[At this moment, she's not a seller,
but the world's happiest bride]

203
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:01,237
Thank you for helping me out.

204
00:11:01,237 --> 00:11:05,634
[The surprise proposal ended successfully]

205
00:11:06,284 --> 00:11:09,322
[Wedding photoshoot completed
despite the bad weather]

206
00:11:09,322 --> 00:11:13,435
I have to work and prepare for my wedding.

207
00:11:13,435 --> 00:11:15,963
I sometimes don't have enough time for both.

208
00:11:15,963 --> 00:11:19,909
I'll still do my best. I can do it.

209
00:11:19,909 --> 00:11:21,985
We will not remain in fifth place.

210
00:11:21,985 --> 00:11:23,076
No way.

211
00:11:23,076 --> 00:11:25,353
We will move up.

212
00:11:25,353 --> 00:11:27,572
Stay tuned for our team.

213
00:11:27,572 --> 00:11:29,469
[Vietnam]

214
00:11:30,156 --> 00:11:32,907
[A night market in northern Vietnam]

215
00:11:33,818 --> 00:11:38,195
[A night full of things to eat and see]

216
00:11:38,195 --> 00:11:42,141
[Someone is livestreaming
in the middle of the night market]

217
00:11:43,004 --> 00:11:46,991
[A Vietnamese star
taking over the night market?]

218
00:11:46,991 --> 00:11:49,856
[Former farmer turned commerce star]
Hello, I'm Luong Van Tuan.

219
00:11:49,856 --> 00:11:53,303
[The eldest of Team Vietnam]

220
00:11:53,303 --> 00:11:57,974
I sell locally grown produce.

221
00:11:57,974 --> 00:11:59,744
[At Team Vietnam's strategy meeting]

222
00:11:59,744 --> 00:12:02,450
I was impressed by what Tuan does.

223
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:05,875
Because when plums are in season,

224
00:12:05,875 --> 00:12:10,002
I know it's hard for farmers to find a market.

225
00:12:10,002 --> 00:12:13,780
Thanks to Tuan, the farmers' shipments
have increased significantly.

226
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:16,153
[A "God seller" who saved local farmers]

227
00:12:16,153 --> 00:12:23,471
[Plums, traditional rice cakes, buffalo jerky,
plum branches, natural honey, and more]

228
00:12:23,471 --> 00:12:26,455
[A local produce specialist]

229
00:12:26,455 --> 00:12:29,764
How many plums did you guys pick?

230
00:12:29,764 --> 00:12:32,263
[His day starts on the farm]

231
00:12:33,493 --> 00:12:37,002
They're in great condition.
They look really delicious.

232
00:12:37,002 --> 00:12:41,083
Aren't the plums bigger this year
than last year?

233
00:12:41,083 --> 00:12:42,280
You're right.

234
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:45,015
They got bigger than last year.

235
00:12:45,015 --> 00:12:48,599
[Premium plums that stand out in size]

236
00:12:51,002 --> 00:12:53,326
This one is huge.

237
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:56,435
[Taking a bite]

238
00:12:58,344 --> 00:12:59,744
It's ripe.

239
00:13:01,298 --> 00:13:03,094
It tastes amazing.

240
00:13:03,094 --> 00:13:06,053
If we harvest them now
and ship them right away to our customers,

241
00:13:06,053 --> 00:13:10,368
I think they'll really love them.

242
00:13:11,041 --> 00:13:15,391
My main job on the farm is

243
00:13:15,391 --> 00:13:19,628
to check the quality and ripeness of the plums.

244
00:13:19,628 --> 00:13:25,822
Other than that,
I manage the farm and pull weeds.

245
00:13:25,822 --> 00:13:31,048
[Luong Van Tuan is dedicated
to quality control of plums]

246
00:13:31,048 --> 00:13:33,582
[Former farmer turned commerce star]
When I'm on a break,

247
00:13:33,582 --> 00:13:38,476
I plan social media content that feels natural.

248
00:13:38,476 --> 00:13:42,896
[Filming content to showcase local produce]

249
00:13:43,641 --> 00:13:46,253
Shoot it from over there.

250
