502
00:28:40,574 --> 00:28:46,644
1,727,119,630 won.

503
00:28:46,644 --> 00:28:49,543
We're pretty close to them.

504
00:28:50,263 --> 00:28:53,150
[15-million-won gap]

505
00:28:53,150 --> 00:28:55,235
This is a whole new deal.

506
00:28:55,235 --> 00:28:57,991
Team Vietnam earned 64 points for total sales,

507
00:28:57,991 --> 00:29:02,409
9 mission points, and 8 fan vote points,

508
00:29:02,409 --> 00:29:05,292
finishing with a total of 81 points.

509
00:29:06,086 --> 00:29:07,405
We got this.

510
00:29:07,405 --> 00:29:09,600
I'm getting goose bumps.

511
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:11,468
I got goose bumps for real.

512
00:29:11,468 --> 00:29:14,218
[Only first and second place remain]

513
00:29:14,839 --> 00:29:20,827
Now, only the top two teams
in the X1 tier remain.

514
00:29:20,827 --> 00:29:25,554
We will announce the final winner of Round 2.

515
00:29:26,155 --> 00:29:28,630
The long-awaited first place
in Round 2 goes to...

516
00:29:29,253 --> 00:29:31,954
After we learned we got first place in Round 1,

517
00:29:31,954 --> 00:29:35,487
we realized that sales are everything.

518
00:29:35,487 --> 00:29:39,316
Our team has years of experience in commerce,

519
00:29:39,316 --> 00:29:42,101
[A family with 100 million followers]
so we're even more confident.

520
00:29:42,724 --> 00:29:46,201
What matters is that I've helped the team
since I got here.

521
00:29:46,201 --> 00:29:49,540
I'm sure Indonesia will win.

522
00:29:49,540 --> 00:29:53,524
[1st generation influencer & actress]
I think we can take first place.

523
00:29:53,524 --> 00:29:55,277
Indonesia's sales are close to ours,

524
00:29:55,277 --> 00:29:58,491
but I think they'll come in a little lower.

525
00:29:58,491 --> 00:30:01,630
And the Round 2 winner is...

526
00:30:01,630 --> 00:30:03,357
I'm so nervous.

527
00:30:03,357 --> 00:30:04,653
I'm seriously shaking.

528
00:30:04,653 --> 00:30:07,028
I suddenly need to use the bathroom.

529
00:30:07,028 --> 00:30:10,392
The Round 2 winner is...

530
00:30:10,392 --> 00:30:11,990
[Who will take first in Round 2?]

531
00:30:11,990 --> 00:30:13,595
Indonesia!

532
00:30:13,595 --> 00:30:15,164
Indonesia!

533
00:30:15,164 --> 00:30:18,903
[Indonesia wins both Rounds 1 and 2]

534
00:30:19,757 --> 00:30:22,057
Whoa, 4.1 billion won.

535
00:30:22,057 --> 00:30:26,175
Indonesia's total sales are

536
00:30:26,175 --> 00:30:31,747
- 4,193,297,426 won.
- How did they do that?

537
00:30:32,891 --> 00:30:35,718
Indonesia takes first place

538
00:30:35,718 --> 00:30:40,324
by a huge margin in total sales.

539
00:30:40,324 --> 00:30:42,324
That's 80 points for sales,

540
00:30:42,324 --> 00:30:44,059
10 for the mission,

541
00:30:44,059 --> 00:30:45,591
and 10 for the fan vote,

542
00:30:45,591 --> 00:30:47,162
for a total of 100.

543
00:30:47,162 --> 00:30:49,731
Congratulations on first place.

544
00:30:51,123 --> 00:30:53,635
- That's a perfect 100.
- Exactly.

545
00:30:53,635 --> 00:30:55,791
- I'm so jealous.
- They're so good.

546
00:30:55,791 --> 00:30:58,090
How are we supposed to beat Indonesia?

547
00:30:58,090 --> 00:30:59,241
100 points?

548
00:30:59,241 --> 00:31:00,491
[Stunned by Indonesia's score]

549
00:31:00,491 --> 00:31:02,491
That's insane.

550
00:31:02,491 --> 00:31:03,645
100 points?

551
00:31:03,645 --> 00:31:07,918
Unfortunately, South Korea came in second

552
00:31:07,918 --> 00:31:13,591
with total sales of 2,129,292,840 won.

553
00:31:13,591 --> 00:31:14,858
We made 2.1 billion won?

554
00:31:14,858 --> 00:31:17,058
- We came in second.
- I think I'm going to cry.

555
00:31:18,290 --> 00:31:20,896
I seriously think I'm going to cry.

556
00:31:20,896 --> 00:31:26,969
[Round 2 Total Sales: Wild Card]

557
00:31:26,969 --> 00:31:29,338
Here are the final X rankings for Round 2.

558
00:31:29,338 --> 00:31:33,075
X1 Diamond goes to Indonesia and South Korea.

559
00:31:33,075 --> 00:31:39,081
X2 Emerald goes to Vietnam, China,
and Singapore & Malaysia.

560
00:31:39,081 --> 00:31:44,352
X3 Platinum goes
to the USA, Thailand, and Japan.

561
00:31:45,055 --> 00:31:47,289
We're still in Diamond.

562
00:31:47,289 --> 00:31:48,324
Okay.

563
00:31:48,324 --> 00:31:51,428
How did we end up third or fourth?

564
00:31:51,428 --> 00:31:54,424
We need to come in first at least once.

565
00:31:54,424 --> 00:31:58,667
China's so mad,
they'll probably sell even more next time.

566
00:31:58,667 --> 00:32:03,505
With the Wild Cards
clearly changing the rankings,

567
00:32:03,505 --> 00:32:05,843
let's see if this trend
continues into the next round

568
00:32:05,843 --> 00:32:08,953
or if we see another shake-up.

569
00:32:12,290 --> 00:32:14,858
Round 3 of the international
commerce competition X THE LEAGUE

570
00:32:14,858 --> 00:32:16,885
is now underway.

571
00:32:16,885 --> 00:32:17,953
Yes.

572
00:32:17,953 --> 00:32:20,152
[Round 3 starts without a break]

573
00:32:23,224 --> 00:32:26,127
We have to do our best.

574
00:32:26,931 --> 00:32:28,905
Finally, Round 3.

575
00:32:30,057 --> 00:32:33,035
Unlike Round 2,

576
00:32:33,035 --> 00:32:36,123
mission points carry more weight in Round 3.

577
00:32:36,123 --> 00:32:38,375
[Round 3 scoring]
Rankings will be based on 100 points,

578
00:32:38,375 --> 00:32:40,542
with 50 points for total sales,

579
00:32:40,542 --> 00:32:44,279
40 for the mission,

580
00:32:44,279 --> 00:32:48,750
and 10 for a preliminary mission
replacing the fan vote.

581
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:50,224
We need ten points.

582
00:32:50,224 --> 00:32:51,624
We need the ten points right now.

583
00:32:51,624 --> 00:32:52,688
Big time.

584
00:32:52,688 --> 00:32:58,360
This round, the fan vote will be
replaced by a preliminary mission.

585
00:32:58,360 --> 00:33:02,990
And that preliminary mission
starts right here, right now.

586
00:33:02,990 --> 00:33:05,405
[Right now?]

587
00:33:10,140 --> 00:33:11,873
So that's why we're here.

588
00:33:13,141 --> 00:33:14,943
[Half worried]

589
00:33:14,943 --> 00:33:16,645
[Half excited]

590
00:33:16,645 --> 00:33:21,750
Do you know where you are right now?

591
00:33:21,750 --> 00:33:23,290
- Seongsu-dong.
- Seongsu.

592
00:33:23,290 --> 00:33:24,290
That's right.

593
00:33:24,290 --> 00:33:27,123
Yes, this is Seongsu,

594
00:33:27,123 --> 00:33:30,350
the heart of Korea's hottest trends.

595
00:33:30,350 --> 00:33:35,030
Here, where pop-ups constantly set new trends,

596
00:33:35,030 --> 00:33:38,133
the sellers will run
their own pop-ups with ten points

597
00:33:38,133 --> 00:33:41,336
from the preliminary mission on the line.

598
00:33:41,336 --> 00:33:42,991
[Prove your selling power at a pop-up]

599
00:33:43,757 --> 00:33:47,257
[35 brands open just for X THE LEAGUE]

600
00:33:47,257 --> 00:33:53,448
The Round 3 preliminary mission is
Pop-up Rush.

601
00:33:55,491 --> 00:33:56,985
A pop-up?

602
00:33:57,891 --> 00:34:00,157
From now on,

603
00:34:00,157 --> 00:34:04,324
[Win over global customers and boost sales]
you'll meet customers here and drive sales.

604
00:34:04,324 --> 00:34:08,657
You could call it an offline fan vote.

605
00:34:08,657 --> 00:34:10,365
Yes, exactly.

606
00:34:11,333 --> 00:34:13,802
So now we're going from online to offline.

607
00:34:15,824 --> 00:34:18,206
We have to win customers over.

608
00:34:18,206 --> 00:34:19,457
We need to get them to buy our products.

609
00:34:19,457 --> 00:34:24,724
There are 35 brand booths here,

610
00:34:24,724 --> 00:34:27,818
and the mission lasts three hours.

611
00:34:27,818 --> 00:34:32,357
At checkout, buyers choose
the country they support,

612
00:34:32,357 --> 00:34:36,023
and the purchase amount counts
toward that country's sales.

613
00:34:36,023 --> 00:34:38,657
- Please choose Team China at checkout.
- Yes.

614
00:34:38,657 --> 00:34:41,424
- Please tap Team Korea.
- Yes, I'm choosing Team Korea.

615
00:34:41,424 --> 00:34:46,768
The ten points for the preliminary mission
will be awarded based on total sales.

616
00:34:46,768 --> 00:34:48,804
- Team USA.
- Team USA.

617
00:34:48,804 --> 00:34:51,958
But I think we'll come out on top
in on-site sales.

618
00:34:51,958 --> 00:34:52,975
We have to come in first.

619
00:34:52,975 --> 00:34:55,858
[Team Korea is confident in on-site sales]

620
00:34:55,858 --> 00:34:58,046
Huh? This is hard.

621
00:35:00,182 --> 00:35:04,023
[Other teams are caught off guard]

622
00:35:04,023 --> 00:35:06,824
- Oh, my gosh.
- Oh, my gosh.

623
00:35:06,824 --> 00:35:10,158
[Content creator with ten million fans]
Selling offline is really different.

624
00:35:10,158 --> 00:35:12,724
Most of our team has never sold offline before.

625
00:35:12,724 --> 00:35:16,231
[A family with 100 million followers]
Most Indonesian sellers sell online.

626
00:35:16,231 --> 00:35:19,768
This is our first time selling offline.

627
00:35:19,768 --> 00:35:23,524
[Other teams are thrown off by offline sales]

628
00:35:23,524 --> 00:35:27,275
[Can online stars win offline too?]

629
00:35:27,275 --> 00:35:29,411
[China is fired up after Round 2]

630
00:35:29,411 --> 00:35:32,557
[Content planner of 50 billion won in sales]
The pop-up mission is only worth 10%.

631
00:35:32,557 --> 00:35:36,385
It's only a minor preliminary mission for now.

632
00:35:36,385 --> 00:35:40,958
Our first goal is to overtake the teams
ahead of us and take second place.

633
00:35:40,958 --> 00:35:45,757
We'll use this as a stepping stone
to really go for second next time.

634
00:35:45,757 --> 00:35:47,663
[China prepares to strike back]

635
00:35:47,663 --> 00:35:51,767
Will the online powerhouses
dominate offline too,

636
00:35:51,767 --> 00:35:55,737
or will a new offline powerhouse emerge?

637
00:35:55,737 --> 00:35:58,540
The Round 3 preliminary mission, Pop-up Rush,

638
00:35:58,540 --> 00:36:00,509
- starts now.
- It starts now.

639
00:36:00,509 --> 00:36:04,095
[Heading into the Round 3 preliminary mission]

640
00:36:11,820 --> 00:36:15,127
[Pop-up Rush customers enter]

641
00:36:16,260 --> 00:36:18,720
[The pop-up is packed]

642
00:36:20,095 --> 00:36:24,002
[Each team gets only three hours]

643
00:36:25,157 --> 00:36:29,158
[Round 3 preliminary mission: Pop-up Rush]

644
00:36:29,771 --> 00:36:32,140
Should I wear this? Which one should I wear?

645
00:36:32,140 --> 00:36:33,608
Have Ma Lingdao hold this.

646
00:36:33,608 --> 00:36:35,810
[Team China gets busy right away]

647
00:36:37,157 --> 00:36:40,615
[Armed with eye-catching gear]

648
00:36:40,615 --> 00:36:43,384
I never thought we'd come in fourth.

649
00:36:44,586 --> 00:36:46,166
So those ten points
from the preliminary mission

650
00:36:46,166 --> 00:36:48,490
became really important.

651
00:36:48,490 --> 00:36:51,791
[What's Team China's winning strategy?]

652
00:36:51,791 --> 00:36:54,190
I think we should stick together
instead of moving around separately.

653
00:36:54,190 --> 00:36:55,997
We'll sell to Korean customers in Korean.

654
00:36:55,997 --> 00:36:58,090
[Can Speak Korean]
Damin and I.

655
00:36:58,090 --> 00:37:03,123
[Owner Guo Qing quickly makes a plan]

656
00:37:03,123 --> 00:37:05,309
[A mysterious giant gift box approaches]

657
00:37:05,309 --> 00:37:07,878
Have Ma Lingdao hold this.

658
00:37:07,878 --> 00:37:10,145
[A secret weapon to draw customers]
Then go up to the customers.

659
00:37:10,145 --> 00:37:12,514
We need to steal customers
from the other teams.

660
00:37:13,230 --> 00:37:15,416
Hands in, everyone.

661
00:37:17,154 --> 00:37:18,987
[Careful prep gives China the edge]

662
00:37:18,987 --> 00:37:20,291
Let's go.

663
00:37:20,291 --> 00:37:22,991
[Booming]
[Ma Lingdao steals the spotlight]

664
00:37:22,991 --> 00:37:25,296
You can choose Team China.

665
00:37:25,296 --> 00:37:27,898
[Team China pitches in Korean]
It can be a lot, or just 500 won.

666
00:37:27,898 --> 00:37:31,123
When purchasing,
please choose the Team China stamp.

667
00:37:31,123 --> 00:37:32,891
- What do I do?
- Choose Team China.

668
00:37:32,891 --> 00:37:34,703
Then you can get a gift later.

669
00:37:34,703 --> 00:37:36,004
[Content planner of 50 billion won in sales]
Our team members speak Korean really well.

670
00:37:36,004 --> 00:37:41,524
We used that language advantage
to draw customers in.

671
00:37:41,524 --> 00:37:44,691
Are you more interested in lifting, or...

672
00:37:44,691 --> 00:37:45,814
[Just as smooth as selling in China]
Your skin is dry?

673
00:37:45,814 --> 00:37:47,924
Then the hydrogel would be better.

674
00:37:47,924 --> 00:37:51,620
[Team China doesn't forget the extras]
Please give this customer plenty of extras too.

675
00:37:51,620 --> 00:37:52,621
For hydration.

676
00:37:52,621 --> 00:37:54,189
They're followers.

677
00:37:56,892 --> 00:38:00,591
[Team China: about 950,000 won so far]

678
00:38:00,591 --> 00:38:02,533
We have another gift for you.

679
00:38:02,533 --> 00:38:04,632
[A surprise gift for buyers]
- One, two, three. - Sing!

680
00:38:06,424 --> 00:38:10,406
[Team China's serenade for a customer]

681
00:38:11,123 --> 00:38:14,876
[An event tailored to Korean customers]

682
00:38:14,876 --> 00:38:17,679
Singing was Xiaoshu Ouni's idea.

683
00:38:17,679 --> 00:38:20,682
Xiaoshu said most of today's customers
would be Korean,

684
00:38:20,682 --> 00:38:24,820
and that Koreans' favorite Chinese song
is "Tian Mi Mi."

685
00:38:24,820 --> 00:38:29,324
[Content planner of 50 billion won in sales]
We sang it for them after they paid.

686
00:38:30,592 --> 00:38:33,555
[China dominates offline too]

687
00:38:36,390 --> 00:38:39,023
Why are so many people buying his clothes?

688
00:38:39,023 --> 00:38:40,035
Try it on.

689
00:38:40,035 --> 00:38:42,691
[One booth catches Team China's eye]
If this fit works, this one will too.

690
00:38:42,691 --> 00:38:44,439
I think this style would look good on you.

691
00:38:44,439 --> 00:38:45,640
[Sales and styling advice at once]
This one's good too.

692
00:38:45,640 --> 00:38:48,743
For this one, you can
roll up the sleeves like I did.

693
00:38:48,743 --> 00:38:54,115
I'm a fashion expert,
so that's my biggest advantage.

694
00:38:54,115 --> 00:38:58,220
[One-on-one styling with an expert eye]
Helping customers buy a complete outfit.

695
00:38:58,220 --> 00:39:02,757
That's my biggest advantage in offline sales.

696
00:39:02,757 --> 00:39:04,192
- What size do you wear?
- This one's a large.

697
00:39:04,192 --> 00:39:05,894
[Kkang Stylist keeps ringing up sales]
- Large? - Try it on.

698
00:39:05,894 --> 00:39:08,997
I feel like we'll win even if I do nothing,
thanks to Kkang Stylist.

699
00:39:08,997 --> 00:39:10,866
Everyone around here
is a Kkang Stylist customer.

700
00:39:10,866 --> 00:39:12,267
I think this would look great on you.

701
00:39:12,267 --> 00:39:15,290
This one's our best seller.
I'd recommend this one.

702
00:39:15,290 --> 00:39:16,757
Want one?

703
00:39:16,757 --> 00:39:19,741
[Team Korea: about 6.5 million won]

704
00:39:19,741 --> 00:39:22,177
[Special guests visit the pop-up]
Hello. Thank you.

705
00:39:22,177 --> 00:39:24,312
[Creator Jo Jin Hyeong, Ballplayer Kim Tae Kyun]
Do you have anything in my size?

706
00:39:25,724 --> 00:39:28,149
[Getting tips from Kkang Stylist]
I think you'd be a 2XL.

707
00:39:28,149 --> 00:39:29,985
- I'm a 4XL.
- 4XL...

708
00:39:29,985 --> 00:39:31,390
Is 2XL the biggest?

709
00:39:31,390 --> 00:39:34,691
[Size issue leads to a hat]
I think a hat would look good on you.

710
00:39:34,691 --> 00:39:37,123
It looks great on you.

711
00:39:37,123 --> 00:39:39,160
[Satisfied]
It looks good on you.

712
00:39:39,160 --> 00:39:42,330
[No hesitation, purchase complete]

713
00:39:42,330 --> 00:39:43,752
[Purchase confirmed: 99,000 won]

714
00:39:44,441 --> 00:39:46,591
Let's do our best to sell.

715
00:39:46,591 --> 00:39:48,670
We need to bring in customers.

716
00:39:49,971 --> 00:39:52,023
[Team Japan gears up for a sales push]

717
00:39:52,023 --> 00:39:56,390
All I can think about right now is
how to turn this around.

718
00:39:56,390 --> 00:39:58,346
Japan is in eighth place.

719
00:39:58,346 --> 00:40:01,924
[Japan finishes last again after Round 1]

720
00:40:01,924 --> 00:40:05,632
I want to show that Japan can pull it off too.

721
00:40:05,632 --> 00:40:08,324
Kii chan is huge in Korea,

722
00:40:08,324 --> 00:40:13,395
and she cheerfully greets people
who recognize her.

723
00:40:13,395 --> 00:40:16,967
[Japan banks on dating-show alum Kii chan]

724
00:40:16,967 --> 00:40:19,023
- Can we take a picture together?
- Sure.

725
00:40:19,023 --> 00:40:20,535
I'm a huge fan.

726
00:40:21,791 --> 00:40:23,838
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

727
00:40:23,838 --> 00:40:26,257
[Customers flock in for Kii chan]

728
00:40:26,257 --> 00:40:28,076
Three, two, one.

729
00:40:30,858 --> 00:40:32,013
I'll buy it now.

730
00:40:32,013 --> 00:40:33,791
[Fan love turns into sales for Japan]

731
00:40:33,791 --> 00:40:36,017
[A Gyaru icon of J-beauty]
I come to Korea

732
00:40:36,017 --> 00:40:39,057
every month for work.

733
00:40:39,057 --> 00:40:40,822
People here are really warm.

734
00:40:40,822 --> 00:40:42,824
Fans and people who recognize me call out,

735
00:40:42,824 --> 00:40:47,095
"Kii chan! Kii chan!" wherever I go,

736
00:40:47,095 --> 00:40:53,691
so I thought I'd be able to interact
with them more easily.

737
00:40:53,691 --> 00:40:58,873
Can I introduce someone real quick?

738
00:40:58,873 --> 00:41:02,043
[Secret weapon? Japan brings in backup]

739
00:41:02,043 --> 00:41:04,079
You should come to Thailand.

740
00:41:04,079 --> 00:41:06,881
We're NipponBoyz.
Please show us lots of love and support.

741
00:41:06,881 --> 00:41:10,518
[A trio based in Thailand]

742
00:41:10,518 --> 00:41:17,625
[From hilariously addictive clips
to music releases]

743
00:41:17,625 --> 00:41:20,362
[Globally known allies join the team]

744
00:41:20,362 --> 00:41:24,165
Could you hold this for a second?

745
00:41:26,390 --> 00:41:29,170
Beautiful!

746
00:41:29,170 --> 00:41:32,023
Would you please hold this product?

747
00:41:32,023 --> 00:41:33,674
- Okay.
- Please hold it.

748
00:41:34,591 --> 00:41:38,346
[Swept up in the hype, product in hand]

749
00:41:38,346 --> 00:41:41,316
Come on in,

750
00:41:41,316 --> 00:41:44,585
beautiful ladies.

751
00:41:47,122 --> 00:41:50,761
[The over-the-top reactions continue]

752
00:41:50,761 --> 00:41:51,893
Try buying this one.

753
