813
00:45:07,322 --> 00:45:09,257
Thank you.

814
00:45:09,257 --> 00:45:10,524
Thank you.

815
00:45:10,524 --> 00:45:12,290
Thank you.

816
00:45:12,290 --> 00:45:15,224
Please vote for Team Vietnam.

817
00:45:15,224 --> 00:45:17,157
